    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1efc0db12e25b74e8c15eecd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周。这位是至今赢下过多场\n辉煌胜利的前辈赛马娘。\n其中尤其是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fa50c37b98c9bb3eb91dc5ef327ecf04a97b6acd185fe331903a0ab482e1b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
