    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7ce672f82719373d7a6589",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――她在那场云集世界名赛马娘的比赛中、\n作为日本代表精彩夺冠的『日本杯』\n令我印象深刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57b97ffe4e7c8a249dd1fc1309f1d80cedf1402d9931a9f4723f2c4fb049247",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f77d3097b865e96ee26e896",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时、我和迷人景致在现场共同见证了\n那场比赛……在狂热、震撼与感动的包围下\n――彼此异口同声地立下誓言。\n\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f76dc03b43a412a3b38df1f5ce03f74f3abaf0fac08c7c6dc846ad503a45b8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a970d85b1ae461b29c6d86f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00a4803d17b32d08d3d9ae9844b52810f0b4162c25dd8d8a1226ea163081d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
