    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d86a12e23ae9c629599ed41a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的间歇跑内容是200m慢跑\n与全力冲刺交替进行。\n先是慢跑、然后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9accb6d26301cb8f928d5b8d4654811ffa9557ac942a16f432499e0ae352fc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114113.json",
      "json_path": [
